    "title": "Altoona defense keeps Ellsworth at bay - NewsBreak",
    "text": "piercecountyjournal.news\nwebsite\nAltoona\nAltoona defense keeps Ellsworth at bay\nBy Andrew Harrington,\n12 hours agoELLSWORTH — Ellsworth could not keep pace with the Altoona Railroaders in the Panthers’ final home game, losing 42-7 to one of the area’s best defenses. The game started on the right note for Ellsworth, as the Panthers forced a third and long after just two plays. A rollout quarterback run got Altoona the first down, but it would be the last of the drive as Ellsworth locked down the next three plays.",
